{"id":"3020cb523ec5a332","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pbderivative.md","title":"Discrete pseudo-Boolean derivative","display":"df-pbderivative — Discrete pseudo-Boolean derivative","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pbderivative","aliases":["27-df-pbderivative"],"display":"df-pbderivative — Discrete pseudo-Boolean derivative","depends_on":["[[27-df-pseudobool]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.4.1","source_statement":"Definition 13.10, Equation (13.37)","source_printed_pages":"586","source_pdf_pages":"610","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pbderivative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pbderivative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pbderivative — Discrete pseudo-Boolean derivative"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"27-df-pseudobool\">27-df-pseudobool</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.4.1"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Definition 13.10, Equation (13.37)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"586"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"610"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"27-df-pseudobool\">27-df-pseudobool</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(i\\in N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathbb B\">\\(b\\in\\mathbb B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall k\\in N\\;\\left((x^{i\\leftarrow b})_k\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}b&amp;k=i,\\\\x_k&amp;k\\neq i.\\end{cases}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall k\\in N\\;\\left((x^{i\\leftarrow b})_k\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}b&amp;k=i,\\\\x_k&amp;k\\neq i.\\end{cases}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J_i f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad(J_i f)(x)\\coloneqq f(x^{i\\leftarrow1})-f(x^{i\\leftarrow0}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J_i f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad(J_i f)(x)\\coloneqq f(x^{i\\leftarrow1})-f(x^{i\\leftarrow0}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 Definition 13.10、(13.37)。本笔记统一保持定义域为 B^n；结果不依赖第 i 坐标，因而可继续使用同一接口求高阶导数。不同于 Boolean exclusive-or derivative。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pseudobool","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pseudobool]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pseudobool","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（see [[27-df-pseudobool]]），$i\\in N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$b\\in\\mathbb B$，$x\\in\\mathbb B^n$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall k\\in N\\;\\left((x^{i\\leftarrow b})_k\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}b&k=i,\\\\x_k&k\\neq i.\\end{cases}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"J_i f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad(J_i f)(x)\\coloneqq f(x^{i\\leftarrow1})-f(x^{i\\leftarrow0}).","display":true}],"bytes":1413,"backlinks":[{"id":"ab9dad394482d61d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n,J_i$ 见 [[27-df-pbderivative]]；$x\\le y$ 表示$\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(x_i\\le y_i)$。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-282","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pbderivative|df-pbderivative — Discrete pseudo-Boolean derivative]]"},{"id":"2896ab0b2ebccfa4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；各类与切换见 [[27-df-pbswitchclasses]]，$\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n$ 见 [[27-df-submodular]]，$J_i$ 见 [[27-df-pbderivative]]。"},{"id":"4b3b6c5abbff3cd9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$x\\in\\mathbb B^n$；$J_i$ 和 $x^{i\\leftarrow b}$（see [[27-df-pbderivative]]）。"},{"id":"83db39dc5813498b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$J_i$（see [[27-df-pbderivative]]），$\\mathrm{Submodular}_n,\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n$（see [[27-df-submodular]]）。"}],"outgoing":["04a7d534f0d6e0dd"]}